      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the present application or invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may address the above needs or issues, and/or may provide novel or improved membrane layers, porous membranes or substrates, separator membranes, separators, composites, electrochemical devices, batteries, methods of making such membranes or substrates, separators, and/or batteries, and/or methods of using such membranes or substrates, separators and/or batteries.</span>
