        <span itemprop="subject">Multi-layered polyolefin membranes</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">are designed to provide an exterior surface that has a low pin removal force, faster wetting, good coating adhesion, tunable shutdown and the like.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0048">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Each layer of polymer</span>
