        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0048">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the invention herein described</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">utilizes both the co-extrusion and lamination of one or more multi-layer membranes to improve surface characteristics.</span>
